SUMMARY:Dispatching a Visual Image
DESCRIPTION:Rosicrucians AMORC\, Santa Rosa\, CA\n**Dispatching a Visual I
 mage:**\n**A Key for Unlocking Opportunities**\n**Presented by Cheri Gandy
 \, S.R.C.**\n\n**Pronaos Convocation for AMORC members only**\n\nThe Santa
  Rosa Pronaos is pleased to welcome our Regional Monitor\, Cheri Gandy to 
 our May AMORC members' convocation. She will present this fascinating topi
 c that reveals a most important key to successful visualization. All curre
 nt members of the Rosicrucian Order AMORC are cordially invited to attend.
  You will learn how to apply this key for achieving your most ardent goals
 .\n\n• Important to know- Doors open for members of the Rosicrucian Orde
 r by 6:30 PM. Please arrive early! Members - please bring your credentials
  or membership dues receipt.\n\nFollowing the meeting:\n1st Tuesday- Mysti
 cal Seekers Series Public Presentation at 8:00 PM\n\nThe Santa Rosa Pronao
 s operates under the law of AMRA. You may give as your heart and mind dire
 ct you.\n\nThe Santa Rosa Pronaos is a 501c3 educational non-profit\, an a
 ffiliated body of the Rosicrucian English Grand Lodge for the Americas and
  the Caribbean.
